/-!
# Inert quadratic stage primes

A nontrivial arithmetic Frobenius in an unramified quadratic number field has
residue degree two. Its prime is therefore the principal prime generated by the
rational prime. Excluding the discriminant divisors and the rational primes below
a finite set of places constructs the stage primes directly from the finite
Chebotarev selection.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 600000
set_option autoImplicit false

noncomputable section

namespace ZInQ.Contrib.RC53Assist.StagePrimes

open NumberField IsDedekindDomain
open ZInQ.Manuscript.RC.SelmerComplex
